    },
    {
      "id": "b1774469938825",
      "type": "quote",
      "content": "Eventually, the goal is to make original features, built entirely in-house from the ground up.",
      "align": "right"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1774473102333",
      "type": "text-md",
      "content": "Independently developed and released character assets — rigged, textured, and animation-ready — for a AAA game title, shipped publicly and used actively by players.",
